      "updated": 1787468641823,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Must sign in, provide detailed business information\n• Manage own products and stock [CRUD, publish, unpublish]\n• Manage own revenue [include taxes, platform income/commission]\n• View comments / ratings as part of buyers\n• Withdraw funds from platform\n• Cancel order \n• Manage own orders and invoices\n• CRUD and manage shop vouchers",
      "fontSize": 17.077892097583305,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 13,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Must sign in, provide detailed business information\n• Manage own products and stock [CRUD, publish, unpublish]\n• Manage own revenue [include taxes, platform income/commission]\n• View comments / ratings as part of buyers\n• Withdraw funds from platform\n• Cancel order \n• Manage own orders and invoices\n• CRUD and manage shop vouchers",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "a9",
      "autoResize": true
    },
